id: pm-rust-oracle-close-preview
title: Track published preview close-reason divergence after the oracle refresh
description: The 2026.11.2 published preview accepts configured closure creates with active roles without an author-controlled reason. Native scalar admission deliberately refuses closure operations outside its documented slice. Keep the divergence explicit rather than weakening native closure admission.
